The world is often plagued by disasters, the most significant of which was the collapse of the USSR. People have already experienced this and are now preparing for capitalism. However, this applies only to those who were in the capital and embraced the changes. Residents of remote areas were practically unaffected, and they are forced to adapt to the new conditions on their own. You will become one of the residents of such a settlement, who will need to get behind the wheel and set out in search of resources, while organizing trade and supplies. And to quickly get started with new affairs, you will need to Wildland Download torrent.

The gameplay is quite simple and straightforward: drive a car, load goods, and transport them to the desired location. Gradually, you'll unlock the entire map, complete side quests, and progress. There are several different types of cars to choose from, and you can customize the paint job and use other upgrades. But to get started, we recommend downloading Wildland Via torrent in Russian. Good luck!

Game features
- a large open world that will allow you to move freely, discover new areas and carefully collect resources from any area you can find;
- tasks are generated completely randomly, so you can easily complete them again and earn money for further development and improvement of transport;
- Keep a close eye on weather conditions, as unexpected changes can make adjustments to your trip and even become a problem, since driving in heavy rain and bad weather is not the safest activity;
- you should not forget that you have to survive, stock up on food, fuel and money for repairs, all this will allow you to achieve success in the future;
- be extremely careful, as death means the end of the story;
- do not forget to carefully monitor your car to prevent it from breaking down and provide all necessary maintenance in a timely manner;
- the game has a reputation system that will allow you to gain access to more challenging missions and advanced vehicle modules;
- Keep a close eye on the map and compass to avoid getting lost and gradually achieve success.

Installation:
1. Download and unzip the game
2. Run the file Wildland.exe
3. Play.
